  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 823.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to set forth the licensing requirements for all home hospice care providers (HHCPs), pursuant to RSA 151:2, I(b).\n\nSource. #5646, eff 6-23-93; ss by #7020, INTERIM, eff 6-23-99, EXPIRED: 10-21-99\n\nNew. #9292, eff 10-9-08, EXPIRED: 10-9-16\n\nNew. #12168, INTERIM, eff 4-29-17, EXPIRED: 10-26-17\n\nNew. #12642, eff 10-9-18",
